# =============================================================================
#  Abode Night View - what does not belong in the repository
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
#  Two rules, and everything here follows from one of them:
#
#    1. Anything build.ps1 can produce from what IS tracked. The .ico files are
#       generated from the PNGs beside them by tools\make-icon.ps1, so they are
#       derived artwork, not artwork.
#    2. Anything a RUN produces. The settings file, the reports, the verifier's
#       baseline: all of it describes the machine it was made on.
#
#  A clean checkout plus .\build.ps1 reproduces every ignored file except the
#  reports, which need an Adobe application in front of them.
# =============================================================================

# --- built binaries ----------------------------------------------------------
*.exe
*.exe.old
*.pdb
dist/

# --- generated artwork -------------------------------------------------------
# assets\*.png are the sources and are tracked; the .ico containers are built
# from them at build time and are 230 KB of the same pixels again.
assets/*.ico

# --- what a run leaves behind ------------------------------------------------
AbodeNightView.ini
NightView.ini
AbodeNightView-diagnostics.txt
AbodeNightView-probe.txt
AbodeNightView-verify.txt
audit-report.txt
audit-*.png

# --- editors and the shell ---------------------------------------------------
.vs/
.vscode/
*.user
*.suo
Thumbs.db
desktop.ini
